claim.claim-text:
15. The method for operating a cooling device (100) for cooling of a metal strip (200) after a forming in a cold rolling stand (300), comprising the following steps:
Spraying a cooling medium (400) onto the surface of the metal strip (200);
wherein the cooling medium (400) is sprayed opposite to the running direction (L) of the metal strip (200) into a cavity (H) between the surface of the metal strip and an opposing plate (500) with an acute spray angle (α).
